 "notes": "Table XV(i) Language, rows = State totals (including/excluding Civil and Military Station, Bangalore), 11 districts/cities, and C&M Station Bangalore; columns = languages x Persons/Males/Females. Table spans printed pp. 204-213 (leaves 212-221); only this leaf transcribed here. Nil cells ('...') omitted; blank cells also omitted. Checks passed: P=M+F for every record; State incl. = State excl. + C&M Station; State excl. = sum of the 11 districts/cities, for every column. Memani, Nagari, Sourashtra are sub-heads of Gujarathi (continued from printed page 209); Gujarathi Total (cols 94-96, leaf 217) = Gujarathi + Memani + Nagari + Sourashtra checked across the two pages. Panchali (Bhili) and Panjabi are directly under Central Group."
